/v1/","context":{"app_id":4951200,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4951200-1847286114041253","game_id":"steam-4951200","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated (Oct 25, #2)","summary":"Thank you for playing the Dungeon Wanderers demo! We've updated the demo based on your feedback. Esc now opens the menu (Tab and the gamepad Start button also work) Added \"Quit Game\" to the menu. It asks for confirmation, then returns you to the desktop When playing solo, the game now pauses while the menu is open (it does not pause in multiplayer) PlayStation, Switch and other controllers now work without any setup. If your controller isn't detected, please restart Steam once Steam will update ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:37:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041253","verified_at":"2026-10-25T10:50:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951200-1847286114040026","game_id":"steam-4951200","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated (Oct 25)","summary":"Thank you for playing the Dungeon Wanderers demo! We've just released an update. Lost belongings from a party wipe now appear together on the floor where you fell, somewhere you can walk to within 30 m of where you arrive on that floor When you enter a floor, you'll now be told if your lost belongings are there If your party is wiped out again before you pick up your lost belongings, they are gone for good. The next run after a wipe is your chance to get them back, so head to that floor and reco","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T16:23:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040026","verified_at":"2026-10-24T18:26:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951200-1847286114037372","game_id":"steam-4951200","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated (Oct 24)","summary":"Thank you for playing the Dungeon Wanderers demo! We've just released an update. The Arena is now playable. Build a party from your monster companions and send them up against other players' teams or ready-made opponents Formation board: freely place your companions in the front, middle, and back rows Opponent board: pick an opponent and confirm before you challenge. Keep winning to unlock the next tier of opponents Results screen: see whether you won, plus your ranking points and medals Fewer g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T17:36:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037372","verified_at":"2026-10-23T20:26:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951200-1847286114035031","game_id":"steam-4951200","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated (Oct 23) / 体験版を更新しました（10/23）","summary":"Thank you for playing the Dungeon Wanderers demo! We've just released an update. You're now less likely to be swarmed right after entering a floor or while activating an exit gate On first launch, the game now shows its preparation progress. The first launch takes a while to get ready, but it hasn't frozen New Game now starts by choosing one of two playable characters, so you can jump straight into the dungeon (D-pad left/right or the left stick to choose) Character creation is still available f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:15:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035031","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:28:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951200-1847286114028776","game_id":"steam-4951200","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Updated (Oct 21)","summary":"Thank you for playing the Dungeon Wanderers demo! We've just released an update. A new boss, the Forest King, has arrived Fights against regular enemies now have real weight: hits on an opening land heavy, and blocked hits feel solid Regular enemies now think: they read distance and coordinate with allies Fixed Boarush getting stuck too close to use its charge attack The boss camera is easier to read: it now sits closer, right behind you, and keeps large bosses on screen Fixed one-handed sword c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:59:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028776","verified_at":"2026-10-21T14:12:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4951200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4951200":"2026-10-26T05:33:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4951200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5126020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4951200","app_id":4951200,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"596dcd704c0ee57fd7d3d63e9ae8d3af388ab0e5f7f3ed685f25618e619f28a6","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_i